      "title": "Runtime injection and audit logs",
      "notes": "### New\n\n- `hush run -- <command>` injects secrets without writing them to disk.\n- Optional append-only audit log (`HUSH_AUDIT_LOG`) recording every decrypt.\n\n### Breaking\n\n- The `hush export` flag `--format=dotenv` is now `--format=env`.\n\nSee the [migration guide](https://hush.example.com/docs/migrate-1.2).",
